From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tom <tompt@seznam.cz>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 03:29:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] soc: apple: sio: Take the pending-request lock with
 interrupts off

The receive path looks requests up under the xarray lock with interrupts
saved, but submission inserts them with plain xa_insert(), and setup
replies submit from hard interrupt context. That is a lock inversion and
can deadlock on one CPU, on every SoC with SmartIO (speakers and
microphones on the A9 and A10 iPads). Make the xarray IRQ-safe and insert
with interrupts off.

[Orchard: from OrchardLinux/orchard#205 (tompta1, 09038adf), split out of
 kernel/patches/drivers/soc-apple/0045 (its T8011 DMA range change is in
 the T8011 SmartIO patch).]

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 drivers/soc/apple/apple-sio-core.c | 11 +++++++++--
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/soc/apple/apple-sio-core.c b/drivers/soc/apple/apple-sio-core.c
index 0fc5b5928..919fbc59e 100644
--- a/drivers/soc/apple/apple-sio-core.c
+++ b/drivers/soc/apple/apple-sio-core.c
@@ -593,7 +593,14 @@ apple_sio_request_async_common(struct apple_sio *sio, u8 endpoint, u8 opcode,
 	request->status = -EINPROGRESS;
 	request->active = true;
 
-	ret = xa_insert(&sio->pending, request->key, request, gfp);
+	/* Setup replies submit requests from hard IRQ context. */
+	if (atomic) {
+		xa_lock_irqsave(&sio->pending, flags);
+		ret = __xa_insert(&sio->pending, request->key, request, gfp);
+		xa_unlock_irqrestore(&sio->pending, flags);
+	} else {
+		ret = xa_insert_irq(&sio->pending, request->key, request, gfp);
+	}
 	if (ret) {
 		apple_sio_tag_free(sio, endpoint, tag);
 		apple_sio_async_put(request);
@@ -1050,7 +1057,7 @@ static int apple_sio_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 	mutex_init(&sio->tx_lock);
 	spin_lock_init(&sio->tx_hw_lock);
 	spin_lock_init(&sio->tag_lock);
-	xa_init(&sio->pending);
+	xa_init_flags(&sio->pending, XA_FLAGS_LOCK_IRQ);
 	spin_lock_init(&sio->desc0_lock);
 	platform_set_drvdata(pdev, sio);
 
